Corresponding Source
====================

Per AGPL-3.0, the Corresponding Source for each released binary includes the build
and packaging scripts needed to regenerate it — the jlink JRE assembly steps, the
vendored and SHA-pinned Suwayomi-Server jar, and the Tauri bundle configuration.
These will be published alongside each release so that the published source
corresponds to the distributed build. Much of this native bundling is planned and
not yet implemented; the commitments above describe what we will publish as each
piece ships.
